インはこちらのサイトの四属性の剣(風)が参照になればと思います\nhttps://medibangpaint.com/use/2022/10/how-to-draw-the-type-of-sword/\n\n\n立ち絵　横乳が見える感じでこちらを見ている、というものでお願いします(構図は描きやすい形でokです)\n　　　　キャラメイクで使用したいので背景はなしでお願いします(透過の関係で)\n\nえち絵　男のちんちんを楽しそうに丁寧にフェラ(亀頭を咥えてる)\n　　　　背面座位でおっぱい揉まれながら中田氏されている(快感を貪っている)というものです\n\nお時間問題なければよろしくお願いします\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@badluck2033/works/38", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@koudera_13th/works/72", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/daad148c/uploads/origins/76eaa117-0343-484c-ac8f-65c40746b2c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a2ded03fa90fcee61b354343d601242", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/daad148c/uploads/origins/76eaa117-0343-484c-ac8f-65c40746b2c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a2ded03fa90fcee61b354343d601242, https://si.imgix.net/daad148c/uploads/origins/76eaa117-0343-484c-ac8f-65c40746b2c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e2c1ca8df6e728ad1a760490125d0a0a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/daad148c/uploads/origins/76eaa117-0343-484c-ac8f-65c40746b2c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8d953628fc40a6232826872afda6a0da 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hello! I'd love to commission you again if you accept. This time, I would like very busty versions of Nimi Nightmare and dooby3D in their summer outfits performing double paizuri. Outfit reference sheets below and a pose similar to the provided link please.\n\nNimi outfit: https://drive.google.com/file/d/17TCjj33NFH64y_LbUbBBMpydyeXZZLTr/view?usp=drivesdk\n\nDooby outfit: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Y2gDknJ9pQDYf0wI_jC3dGjgv2HP5QrU/view?usp=drivesdk\n\nPose: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DdTOpPKBHW7AHuLrnEI4JwuHQHX86Fee/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@koudera_13th/works/71", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/db533149/uploads/origins/d5b9e21c-0a13-4dd2-9068-0c2d0